# 1. Execute `Gerar token JWT` obter e armazenar o token das request. Este token

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/pegasus/agency

### 1. Gerar token JWT
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=user

### 2. Cadastrar agência
POST {{baseUrl}}/desafio/cadastrar
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
    "posX": 2,
    "posY": 7
}


### 3. Consultar distâncias das agências
GET {{baseUrl}}/desafio/distancia?posX=6&posY=5
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
